Derivation & upstream credits
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cycletron is built on, and derived from, the Strudel live-coding ecosystem:

- Strudel — the pattern language and web live-coding environment.
  Copyright (C) Strudel contributors. Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later.
  https://strudel.cc  ·  https://codeberg.org/uzu/strudel
  Cycletron's frontend (the WASM REPL: editor, scheduler, audio-manager,
  worklet, visualizer) is adapted from Strudel / strudel-rs and its
  mini-notation dialect is Strudel-compatible. Cycletron is not affiliated
  with or endorsed by strudel.cc.

- strudel-rs — the Rust port of the Strudel engine that powers Cycletron's
  audio (embedded as a pinned git dependency and as the prebuilt WASM in
  `ui/pkg/`). Copyright (C) strudel-rs contributors. Licensed under
  AGPL-3.0-or-later.
  https://codeberg.org/nukleas/strudel-rs

Corresponding source (AGPL §6) for the prebuilt engine binary in `ui/pkg/`
is the strudel-rs tree at the exact revision pinned in the workspace
`Cargo.toml` (`strudel-*` / `midi-to-strudel` git `rev`).

Bundled third-party audio assets (samples, drum machines, soundfonts) and
their licenses are credited in ATTRIBUTION.md.
